// Notice board notes.
//
// Anyone with the page can add, edit, move and delete notes. There are no
// identities here: the token's permissions allow all of that, and these rules
// don't authorise anything.
//
// The list's JSON schema already says what a note looks like: a colour, a
// position on the board, and up to 500 characters of text. What a schema can't
// do is compare a note with how it was before, and that's what this rule is
// for. The colour shows who wrote a note, so nobody can recolour someone
// else's.

require update "a note keeps its colour":
  unchanged("/colour")
  else "a note's colour can't be changed";
